00:44:43.847 --> 00:44:46.583 align:start size:84% position:16%
because they haven't
thought about it.

00:44:46.583 --> 00:44:48.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's why I wanted to bring
my kids to Auschwitz.

00:44:48.419 --> 00:44:52.556
I need you to feel it so
you can think about it,

00:44:52.556 --> 00:44:55.659 align:start size:84% position:16%
and really look at
this as a possibility.

00:44:55.659 --> 00:44:57.895 align:start size:84% position:16%
And once you do
that and you realize

00:44:57.895 --> 00:45:02.833
by the grace of God I'll
stand then you're ready,

00:45:04.835 --> 00:45:09.840
but we have got to prepare
ourselves now to be ready

00:45:11.542 --> 00:45:15.779
because if you're ready
now the problems go away.

